00:02:55.630 --> 00:03:02.920
no good.  We want to keep the wrist relatively&nbsp;straight some light natural bend is is okay so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:15.610
all four fingers on the first string, thumb to the&nbsp;left, straight wrist, and now we can start P A M I P&nbsp;A M I.

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:22.010
That's the basic tremolo technique.

